{"id":66719,"date":"2025-02-16T19:37:34","date_gmt":"2025-02-16T18:37:34","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=66719"},"modified":"2026-09-04T10:19:56","modified_gmt":"2026-09-04T09:19:56","slug":"sousoes-trail","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sousoes-trail\/","title":{"rendered":"Sous\u00f5es Trail 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Sous\u00f5es Trail 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Sous\u00f5es Trail 2026<\/strong> regressa aos trilhos hist\u00f3ricos de <strong>Felgueiras<\/strong> no domingo, <strong>22 de novembro de 2026<\/strong>, celebrando a sua 4\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o sob o lema \u00abUm trilho com identidade!\u00bb. Organizado pelo <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Felgueiras<\/strong>, o evento homenageia a linhagem nobre medieval dos Sous\u00f5es, intimamente ligada \u00e0 funda\u00e7\u00e3o da nacionalidade portuguesa, proporcionando uma imers\u00e3o desportiva \u00edmpar nas paisagens e no patrim\u00f3nio secular do concelho.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com centro nevr\u00e1lgico instalado no <strong>Parque Urbano da Bou\u00e7a<\/strong>, os percursos cruzam as encostas e veredas do <strong>Vale do Bugio e Ferro<\/strong>, trechos emblem\u00e1ticos da <strong>Rota do Rom\u00e2nico<\/strong> como o c\u00e9lebre Mosteiro de Pombeiro, e os vales entre Jugueiros e Sendim. A competi\u00e7\u00e3o integra o desafiante <strong>Trail Longo de 31 km<\/strong> (D+ 1455 m), o veloz <strong>Trail Curto de 17 km<\/strong> (D+ 815 m) e a participativa <strong>Caminhada de 11 km<\/strong> (D+ 600 m). Os atletas disp\u00f5em de cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica por chip da <strong>StatusMarathon<\/strong>, pr\u00e9mios finisher exclusivos, balne\u00e1rios com duches quentes e ricos abastecimentos tradicionais.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weig